  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the button for muting/unmuting is mapped to V and the VRChat window must be focused when pasting in URLs for Video Players you will always mute/unmute yourself while doing that.\nTwo simple solutions:\n1. Map mute/unmute to a key that isnt mapped to (like M for Mute)\n2. Ignore V being pressed when Ctrl is being held.",
